  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "我leh tsih-tsuh kap作孽"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：張寶明&nbsp;</b></span></p><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj-Q13Nf2M0CW-8SFT8fi96iGBD7QWRhgKkTefFsvQCUHQWXkPiIXtpR1EMIqsvv3_XUXsNY-G15xslASlA2Fi4DOf9S_1pe29-Pahh7Bo7PxAc9_DG3clE5fM2I1uxCg3MsWR7LLM1mJOG5VvogwzQiDlW_VRnRmkXQqw94r1X3WMferu1qar2z8m2YA=s1889\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1327\" data-original-width=\"1889\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj-Q13Nf2M0CW-8SFT8fi96iGBD7QWRhgKkTefFsvQCUHQWXkPiIXtpR1EMIqsvv3_XUXsNY-G15xslASlA2Fi4DOf9S_1pe29-Pahh7Bo7PxAc9_DG3clE5fM2I1uxCg3MsWR7LLM1mJOG5VvogwzQiDlW_VRnRmkXQqw94r1X3WMferu1qar2z8m2YA=w640-h450\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsit篇寫--ê是「媽祖婆」ê文章，iáu是決定beh kā寫--出-來，thang好記錄我細漢hit時tsūn，到tann iáu放bē離--ê、有夠siàu念ê記持。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">頭一層，是因為阿媽洗頭，hōo我對茶箍kap水hia̍p仔特別有印象。「無頭--ê，來hia̍p水hōo我洗頭。」阿媽見若beh洗頭就leh hiàm--我--ah。一塊深咖啡色圓圓ê茶箍，囥tī柴做ê雪文kheh仔內底，伊倒手提--leh，正手ná leh pué he長長長ê頭鬃，m̄是驚我看著伊頭毛khàm面ê恐怖pān，是驚去khàm著目睭，beh hānn入去水hia̍p仔埕跋倒。「來！水hia̍p hōo大港。我講停tsiah停。」自án-ne，我水hia̍p仔大力一直hia̍p，生狂hia̍p，到kah阿媽huah好，我是喘phēnn-phēnn、phēnn-phēnn喘--ah，真爽快。看著大大大港ê水沖落去阿媽ê頭殼，水滴kap水絲噴tuì四箍liàn-tńg去，tuè阿媽頭攑kuân攑低，有時近有時遠，hiàm我hia̍p水根本就是叫我去sńg水hia̍p仔，有夠趣味。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我雖bóng狡怪koh tsih-tsuh，不而過，我心真幼路。阿媽khe̍h茶箍蹛頭鬃ná抹，茶箍囥--leh，有時用雙手kā頭鬃jio̍k hōo規團，有時kā一tshok頭毛挲tuì毛尾去。真怪哉，是按怎無半點仔pho，jio̍k-jio̍k挲挲--leh就清氣--ah，茶箍ê清氣力有tsiah-nī仔強--ooh！Tsit-má若有tè khe̍h著íng過ê茶箍，我定著beh提來kap清潔精做試驗。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Koh一層，因為我摃tshio雞王，阿媽放刁beh摃斷我ê跤骨，hōo我感覺伊疼我tsit个查埔孫是假--ê，我比tshio雞王khah不如。Beh暗仔，我ê khang-khuè是ài去雞tiâu仔飼雞仔。雞tiâu仔門一下開--開，tshio雞王就衝過來啄--我，m̄知影ē án-ne，suah去hōo啄著跤胴骨，烏青兼破皮，疼kah kiōng-beh tshuah尿，氣ka̍h，當然掠tshio雞王來出怨氣。Tsua̋nn走去攑一枝竹棍仔，入去kā siāu。因為規个雞tiâu仔雞飛雞走，ko̍k-ko̍k叫koh雞雞叫，阿媽走出來看，就án-ne罵--我。我ke̍h-kuāinn koh作孽，自hit斗，入去若看tshio雞王tsông--過-來，我就展我liú-lia̍h ê跤手閃tuì邊--a，順suà用手tuì雞後擴kā pa--落-去，m̄驚伊koh衝--過-來，仝款徙tuì邊--a，仝款用手tuì雞後擴koh kā pa--落-去，連suà幾若斗，假痟！Tshio雞王哪ē贏--我？乖乖閃去邊--a，等我走tsiah敢過來食料。後尾幾斗去mā lóng ài演tsit齣人pa雞ê不倫戲，當然，tshio雞王mā是有頭殼--ê，教ē乖。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">是按怎tshio雞王比我ê跤骨khah有值，原來阮兜有雞thang刣、有雞thang賣lóng靠伊。伊ê種好，是阿媽m̄知用啥法度試--出-來--ê，是阿媽親點ê雞王，規雞tiâu仔lóng是伊leh管，lóng是伊thn̂g ê種。雖bóng án-ne，我mā是不服：人不如雞！Sian講to講bē通。Tse是hit久懵懂所致，tsit久想--起-來，應該是阿媽罵--人ê話母niā-niā，無歹意tsiah tio̍h。怪lóng怪hit時代威權ê傳統教育，啥人叫阿媽規世人性地歹。有不服、有怨嘆，thài敢去問序大人？揣序大人參詳？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">趁tsit兩層íng過ê記憶，影像清清楚楚tī記持--裡一斗koh一斗影--過ê時，緊kā寫--起-來，若無，恐驚阿媽ē tuì我ê記持--裡消失--去。&nbsp;</span></p><div><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjQYcEyK1wlzlZyrR03g9AjGpWDERsji8_v5Zx3ZTgKA2z7iLBP_JmrmVVdKN-EYZ6YaskxO1lnpnBlZ3cZax8RGY0aJLUMKy2GIDLdG7EMVDVYVGz4dH_WQWs576txygb0zBxh2CZ3FyzB3fMT2hiRpzmY7eE3IICYUlk_fWmVPfoN9A1C-JVauX61RQ=s1424\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjQYcEyK1wlzlZyrR03g9AjGpWDERsji8_v5Zx3ZTgKA2z7iLBP_JmrmVVdKN-EYZ6YaskxO1lnpnBlZ3cZax8RGY0aJLUMKy2GIDLdG7EMVDVYVGz4dH_WQWs576txygb0zBxh2CZ3FyzB3fMT2hiRpzmY7eE3IICYUlk_fWmVPfoN9A1C-JVauX61RQ=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi_r8szNDv9-W0-AbtZ0BcitYopvx368vGKnvuULyVDsnWMHXWm0fYeVNws33el5NRrbnTflqFlu9r6brT4zdcfrhAP_6GBsKY1jvBHru5L5v-cAgvN3vx8nRbMGoUAZq-9I84IRDLENLKueY251qHVyQyCpaJgbwVFu8Tt37MH_qZSUR3c-U4N5EQ3AA=s3036\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi_r8szNDv9-W0-AbtZ0BcitYopvx368vGKnvuULyVDsnWMHXWm0fYeVNws33el5NRrbnTflqFlu9r6brT4zdcfrhAP_6GBsKY1jvBHru5L5v-cAgvN3vx8nRbMGoUAZq-9I84IRDLENLKueY251qHVyQyCpaJgbwVFu8Tt37MH_qZSUR3c-U4N5EQ3AA=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiI0iUpHejGXKsVzC6aSKcK-4TBomxYyhuAYgbka9A8D5Gr1La6Cx2S958dxMUylWMKdw6MZWcIjhgqv2GpTJ4Smd5OFfj5Cs8hlc_cgP6pqsJoTsmIMPwJ8Ufu2y2X09J_42-5aZP6J8vCbww1lHB5Hk_pV03S0-Jd7OBwbiza0879pKcHrLyjpUf2AA=s3036\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiI0iUpHejGXKsVzC6aSKcK-4TBomxYyhuAYgbka9A8D5Gr1La6Cx2S958dxMUylWMKdw6MZWcIjhgqv2GpTJ4Smd5OFfj5Cs8hlc_cgP6pqsJoTsmIMPwJ8Ufu2y2X09J_42-5aZP6J8vCbww1lHB5Hk_pV03S0-Jd7OBwbiza0879pKcHrLyjpUf2AA=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">#</b><span><span><b>台灣人寫真</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報333期，2021年12月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
